<title>USA: Aliant Communications Inc Q4 oper net up.</title>
<headline>Aliant Communications Inc Q4 oper net up.</headline>
<dateline>LINCOLN, Neb. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in Thousands Except Per Share Amounts)</p>
<p>					     Three Months Ended Dec. 31</p>
<p>						     1996	     1995*</p>
<p> Total operating revenues		  68,773	    61,134</p>
<p> Operating income			    11,354	    10,679</p>
<p> Operating per share			    .31		 .29</p>
<p>					    Twelve Months Ended Dec. 31</p>
<p>						    1996		1995*</p>
<p> Total operating revenues		 264,225	   225,089</p>
<p> Operating income			    44,954	    42,059</p>
<p> Operating per share			   1.22		1.22</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1995 results before a $0.45 a share accounting change charge and $0.33 a share charge for voluntary early retirement.</p>
<p>Full-year 1995 results before a $0.48 a share accounting change charge, $0.03 a share restructuring charge and $0.35 a share early retirement charge.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
